A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the comedy duo known as '''[[wikipedia:Tutorial (comedy duo)|Tutorial]]''' (チュートリアル Chūtoriaru) was held from October 22nd, 2014 to December 31st, 2014. The collaboration included exclusive [[Serial Codes]] going on during collab period.

==Event==
Character from Tutorial are available to unlock in the Battle Cats during the event period.

* 【Special】 [[Tutorial Cat (Special Cat)|Tutorial Cat]] - Obtained via inputting a [[Serial Codes|Serial Code]] during the collaboration event.

